[B]PSA: DerpFest will not get MEETS_STRONG_INTEGRITY support[/B]

DerpFest builds will not get support for the Play Integrity [B]MEETS_STRONG_INTEGRITY[/B] verdict.

[B]Why:[/B] my attempts to make STRONG available on DerpFest left my Pixel 11 Pro XL unbootable. I'm not shipping something that can do that to your phone, so DerpFest stays without it.

[B]What this means[/B]
[LIST]
[*]DerpFest won't pass STRONG, and requests or bug reports about STRONG on DerpFest will be closed.
[*]Please don't try to force it on DerpFest yourself: the same attempts are what broke booting here.
[*]Everything else in DerpFest is unaffected.
[/LIST]

[B]Need STRONG?[/B] The Evolution X builds for the Pixel 11 series support it today:
[LIST]
[*]Pixel 11 Pro XL / Pixel 11 Pro: [URL=https://xdaforums.com/t/4804712/]Evolution X for kodiak and grizzly[/URL]
[*]Pixel 11: [URL=https://xdaforums.com/t/4804723/]Evolution X for cubs[/URL]
[*]Pixel 11 Pro Fold: [URL=https://xdaforums.com/t/4804826/]Evolution X for yogi[/URL]
[/LIST]

Questions are welcome in this thread.
